  "details": "I found a problem, VRC Constraint don't keep other each GameObjects, Here the video I show, You'll understand whats the issue.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/T7RLcXs5c0s\n\n---\n\nRepro steps:\n\n1. Create two or more VRChat constraints of the same type on separate game objects with unique assigned source transforms.\n\n2. Select all of these game objects at once.\n\n3. Modify the sources list by appending a new transform or by modifying the size of the list.\n\nExpected result:\n\nThe existing assigned transforms keep their original values on each constraint instance.\n\nActual result:\n\nThe references all collapse to match one of the selected constraint objects instead.",
